certainly a solution that says we want more

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:50.000
sort of free market, um, uh, possibilities
rather than a consumer protection angle. Is

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:51.662
that, am I interpreting that correctly or
not?

00:10:51.662 --> 00:10:57.850
It goes back, it goes back to the concept
David of openness and interconnected interconnection.

